      "content": "ibuprofen? i already took some of that like an hour ago and it didnt really do anything for the head pain. and i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, the wait times are insane and i dont have insurance that covers much. are you sure it could be a stroke? it feels more like just a really heavy pressure and that weird tongue feeling. can i just wait this out at home with some more ibuprofen and maybe some tylenol?",
